Now add a helper `property(int id, Signal<?> signal)` to PathlandNode:
```java
/**
 * Set a property value from a signal. A non-constant signal is recorded as a
 * node-level binding (the emitter re-emits only this property on change); a
 * constant signal just sets the plain value (no binding overhead).
 */
public void property(int id, Signal<?> signal) {
    if (signal == null) {
        return;
    }
    Object value = ReactiveValues.from(id, signal);
    properties.put(id, value);
    if (!(signal instanceof ConstantSignal)) {
        propertyBindings.put(id, signal);
    }
}
