 * ({@code .modifiers(EnvironmentBinding.with(e -> e.key(...).value(...)))}): the value
 * is active only while the wrapped subtree renders, and an outer binding is restored
 * afterward (nearest wins). Reading via {@code Environment.value(key)} always returns a
 * signal (spec DSL.md §5.5). Applied as a modifier value with {@code .modifiers(...)}.
 */
public final class EnvironmentBinding implements ViewModifier {

